        {
          "id": "conversion_to_log10",
          "label": "Convert ln(x) to log₁₀(x)",
          "formula": "Math.log(inputs.number) * 0.434294",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "conversion_to_ln",
          "label": "Convert log₁₀(x) to ln(x)",
          "formula": "Math.log10(inputs.number) * 2.302585",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Logarithmic Rules\n\n1. **Product Rule**: log_a(xy) = log_a(x) + log_a(y)\n2. **Quotient Rule**: log_a(x/y) = log_a(x) - log_a(y)\n3. **Power Rule**: log_a(x^p) = p·log_a(x)\n4. **Reciprocal Rule**: log_a(1/x) = -log_a(x)\n5. **Base Rule**: log_a(a) = 1\n6. **Unity Rule**: log_a(1) = 0\n\n## Conversion Formulas\n\n- **log₁₀(x) = 0.434294 × ln(x)**\n- **ln(x) = 2.302585 × log₁₀(x)**\n- **log₂(x) = 1.442695 × ln(x) = 3.321928 × log₁₀(x)**"
    }
